      <h1 class="jr-h1">Is Collagen Vegetarian? The Honest Answer for Indian Buyers</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">This is a question we get every week, and we should answer it against our own interest: our collagen is made from fish, so it is not vegetarian. Here is why no collagen supplement really is, what the plant-based labels contain instead, and what vegetarians can actually do.</p>

